<title>FINLAND: Cultor to sell fish feed business.</title>
<headline>Cultor to sell fish feed business.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food, feed and bakery group Cultor Oy said in a statement on Monday it had agreed to sell its Ewos fish feed business activities in Denmark and Sweden to Danish company  Aller Molle A/S.</p>
<p>&quot;The effect of the deal on Cultor's result is neutral,&quot; Cultor said.</p>
</text>
